window.products.push({"id":978155,"name":"EROMMY 50 in Electric Fireplace Insert,Recessed and Wall Mounted Fireplace with Timer, Free Standing, Remote Control, Touch Screen, Overheating Protec","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":219.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oPaA8ZptL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔥【12 Colors Adjustable Flame】This electric fireplace has 12 realistic flame colors and 5 brightness options. This electric fireplace is designed to choose a log or crystal ember bed. The flame beautifully imitates the burning of a fire, which gradually brightens when it is opened, and slowly extinguishes when it is closed. The flame effect and heating function are independent of each other, and the flame effect can be operated with or without heating. 🔥【Safety and Energy Saving】This electric fireplace can adjust any temperature from 62F to 82F. The 5120BTU fireplace heating level can be adjusted to 750W or 1500W depending on your room temperature, providing up to 400 square feet of auxiliary area heating. The fireplace will heat a cool room, but it will not replace the main heat source. Please pay attention to reserve about 8 inches of top exhaust and heat dissipation space for your exquisite fireplace. 🔥【Overheating Protection Design】This CSA and ETL safety certified linear fireplace has a safe thermal cut-out for overheating protection. Once the temperature is too high, it will stop heating. The automatic timer shutdown time can be selected from 1 hour to 8 hours, providing you with flexible time. 🔥【Flexible Control Modes】This electric fireplace insert has two modes: screen button control and remote control. With the LED LCD display, you can easily control this fireplace by lying on the sofa or bed, which is very convenient. The LED indicator will dim when not in use to hide it so as not to interfere with your sleep. This ensures that you have complete control when relaxing without affecting the overall appearance of the fireplace. 🔥【Recessed&Wall Mounted&Free Standing】No assembly required for this fireplace and it supports three installation modes: wall-mounted, built-in and free standing. You can almost immediately enjoy the wonderful experience of the fireplace by opening the package and connecting the power supply. Your friends are excited to reach out and touch the dancing realistic flames behind the glass. It is very suitable for use in various rooms such as living room, bedroom, kitchen, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oPaA8ZptL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EROMMY","source_asin":"B0BZNPS7RH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-978155","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZNPS7RH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZNPS7RH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
