window.products.push({"id":978245,"name":"Shark IC205 IONFlex DuoClean Cordless Ultra-Light Vacuum, Red (Renewed)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31CjMoyKQRL._AC_.jpg","description":"Enjoy the benefits of DuoClean with the convenience of cord-free power from removable, rechargeable lithium-ion batteries. Reach, store, and charge anywhere with MultiFLEX Technology. The Shark IONFlex provides the benefits of DuoClean technology with cordless convenience. What's included: 8'' Crevice Tool 8'' Crevice Tool Pet Multi-Tool Pet Multi-Tool ION Power Pack Battery ION Power Pack Battery Charging Cord Charging Cord Precision Duster Precision Duster ION Power Pack The ION Power Pack is a 25.2-volt removable, rechargeable lithium-ion battery pack. The ION Power Pack lithium-ion battery provides cleaning power where and when you need it with a variety of charging options. Lights on the ION Power Pack show the remaining charge in your ION Power Pack while in use. They also blink and illuminate to show the status of the ION Power Pack while charging. In addition, the lights will illuminate in certain configurations to inform you of any issues with the ION Power Pack. Your ION Power Pack should take approximately 3.5 hours to reach a full charge. DuoClean Technology The IC205 features DuoClean Technology, a combination of a bristle brush and soft roller invented to clean fine dust and small and large particles on both carpets and floors. Instead of a single brushroll, the IONFlex has two brushrolls engineered to work in unison, removing large debris and fine dust particles from your floors and carpets. MultiFLEX Technology MultiFLEX Technology folds over for compact, free-standing storage and provides flexible reach to get under beds, couches, and tables. Smart Response Technology Smart Response Technology provides a range of performance-enhancing power settings, tailored for your cleaning needs on carpets and floors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31CjMoyKQRL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazon Renewed","source_asin":"B07JNSP7H1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-978245","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JNSP7H1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JNSP7H1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
