window.products.push({"id":978314,"name":"TOSOT 10,000 BTU Window Air Conditioner - Energy Star, Modern Design, and Temperature-Sensing Remote - Window AC for Bedroom, Living Room, and attics ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":339.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JHskT4cQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"QUICK COOLING: Give your hot room the cold shoulder. TOSOT 10,000 BTU Window Air conditioners are best for spaces up to 450 sq. ft. If your space has high ceiling, an open floor plan, or a lot of traffic, you may want to consider sizing up. MODERN DESIGN: This ain't your grannie's Window AC. Gone are the eyesores of yesterday, with their ugly metal grilles messing up the flow of your interior decorating skills. Bring the art gallery to your home by installing this sleek, minimalistic air conditioner in your living room window. 1 PRODUCT, 3 USES: At TOSOT, we want our products to solve as many of your problems as possible. That's why we're giving you three products for the price of one! This is not only a Window Air Conditioner, but also comes with modes for fan-only and for dehumidifying. SMART TEMPERATURE CONTROL: On most air conditioners, the thermostat is located on the unit itself. TOSOT Air Conditioners uses a thermostat is located on the remote, meaning your AC will cool your space based on the temperature around your remote (which is probably close to you, right?) SAVES YOU MONEY: TOSOT Window Air Conditioners are Energy-Star rated, making them better for the environment and your wallet. Everyone may not agree on climate change, but the one thing we can all stand behind is lower utility bills.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JHskT4cQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOSOT","source_asin":"B07Q4N4GDB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-978314","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q4N4GDB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q4N4GDB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":978315,"name":"Baguette Pan - 3 Brush Included French Bread Baking Pan Nonstick Perforated Baguette Pan 4 Loaves Loaf Bake Mold Toast Cooking Bakers Molding Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vHKHw0Z1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"No need to go to the French Bakery to enjoy some good french style bread! Do it Yourself! Our Baking Pan has what it takes to bake perfect baguettes. It is designed in a non-stick coating made from specialized food quality carbon steel, safe to use and resistant to up to 500°F.The perforations at the bottom of the pan are useful to bake the loaves of bread evenly. 4 Wells to cook 4 loaves at once! Size:15\"\"(L) X 13\"\"(W) X 0.98\"\" (Thickness), the width of each gutter is 2.8 -------- Baguette Recipe --------- Prep Time 30 mins Cook Time 40 mins Resting Time 2 hrs Ingredients 1.75 ounces warm water 1 1/2 teaspoons active dry yeast 16 ounces bread flour 2 teaspoons kosher salt 10 ounces cool water Instructions 1.Measure the warm water in a small bowl and sprinkle the yeast on top. Set aside. 2.Measure the bread flour into a large bowl and stir in the salt. 3.Make a well in the center of the flour mixture, and stir in the dissolved yeast. 4.Add the cool water, a little at a time, while stirring, just until a shaggy dough has formed (you may not need to use all of the water). 5.Cover the bowl with plastic wrap and allow it to rest for 30 minutes. 6.Transfer the dough to a lightly floured work surface, and gently press it into a rectangle and fold into thirds.  Turn 90 degrees and repeat.  7.Place the dough in a large oiled bowl, and cover with plastic wrap.  Allow it to rise in a warm place for 1 to 2 hours, or until doubled in bulk. 8.Divide the dough into 4 equal portions, and shape each one into a long loaf (about 15-inches long and 1 1/2-inches in diameter), with pointed ends.   9.Place the loaves on a floured towel, cover with oiled plastic wrap, and allow to rise for 30 to 45 minutes. 10.Preheat the oven to 450 degrees F, and place a pan of water on the bottom rack. 11.Uncover the baguettes and transfer to lightly\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vHKHw0Z1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MBDC","source_asin":"B0838FV95Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-978315","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0838FV95Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0838FV95Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
