window.products.push({"id":978459,"name":"BESTBEING Knife Sharpener for Straight and Serrated Knives, 2-Stage Diamond Coated Wheel System, Sharpens Dull Knives Quickly, Safe and Easy to Use (1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lxLkgF28L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Nomad Kitchen handle knife sharpener is an indispensable tool which is necessary in any kitchen. Using dull knives is dangerous. Most injuries and cuts in the kitchen happen because of dull knives. A razor sharp blade cuts thin and easily and is much easier and comfortable to work with it. Innovative TWO-STAGE SHARPENING SYSTEM. Our Knife Sharpener tool is a 2 stage sharpening wheel system. In the first stage, a wheel with a diamond cover works and provides rough sharpening. A ceramic wheel, which is used during the second stage, ensures exact sharpening and the honing of your blade. The diamond wheels are effective because they sharpen \"into\" and \"out of\" the knife edge simultaneously. The Nomad Kitchen sharpener for blades is an absolutely universal tool for recovering old knives. The professional knife sharpener is great for sharpening both metallic and ceramic blades. THE PREMIUM QUALITY KNIFE SHARPENING SYSTEM. The knife sharpener system is made of ABS plastic and stainless steel. Such a combination of materials makes every kitchen accessory practical to use and worry-free. The modern stylish design of this sharpener for a knife will be appropriate for both home and professional kitchens. We guarantee the replacement of the product if it’s faulty! YOUR SATISFACTION IS OUR PRIORITY . We believe that you deserve the best professional-grade kitchen accessories available, that’s why we developed this elite knife sharpener.  A comfortable handle and stable base make the sharpening process easy even for those who’ve never used a sharpener for kitchen knives.  You can rest assured that your investment is 100% risk-free with our premium 100% satisfaction guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lxLkgF28L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BESTBEING","source_asin":"B07BLXJDCD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-978459","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BLXJDCD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BLXJDCD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
