window.products.push({"id":978499,"name":"Airtight Food Storage Container Set 3 Pcs-0.85*2+2QT, BPA-Free Push to Open Design 100% Leakproof Stackable Storage Containers for Coffee, Pasta, Cere","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aVy34Zh4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you dream of a uniform and well-organized kitchen pantry, where one food container coordinates with the others and are BPA-free, then you've come to the right place. Vivostore presents Air Tight Food Storage Containers with 2 Sizes Stackable Containers with removable and washable lids, moisture-proof and airtight food preservation. People take care of their healthy foods that include its preparation but the containers where they are served are equally important. MODULAR STACKABLE DESIGN: Create a neat and organized space. Pantry organization calls for space-saving storage. All of our food storage containers feature stackable designs. These containers easily nest when not in use and when in use their stacking feature allows for safe, stable stacking with other containers of the same brand, or even with similar brands. PUSH TO OPEN LID WITH SILICONE AIRTIGHT SEAL: Keep contaminants out of your food during storage. This ensures that your ingredients remain fresh and dry for a long period of time. Push the button down for an airtight seal that opens again with another simple press of the button. When the button is popped open, it doubles as a built-in handle for the lid. Sepcification: Materials: AS/ABS/Silicone Container: Impact Resistant ABS Container Temperature Tolerance: -4°F ~ 176°F (-20°C ~ 80°C) Lid: Impact Resistant ABS Lid Temperature Tolerance: -4°F ~ 158°F (-20°C ~ 70°C) Built-in Screw: Stainless Steel 304 Lid/Container Seal: Silicone 330 Care Instructions: 1. Microwaves and high temperatures can deform the lid seal. This can affect the airtight capacity of the lid. 2. Lid should be disassembled prior to cleaning. Please ensure all components are completely dry before reassembly and use. 3. If storing hot liquids: do not turn upside down, or shake container. 4. Do not wash, clean or scrub with abrasive brushes or abrasive cleaning powders.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aVy34Zh4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vivostore","source_asin":"B0982NWV7G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-978499","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0982NWV7G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0982NWV7G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
