window.products.push({"id":978552,"name":"Taomika 30 Pcs White Pampas Grass, Soft and Fluffy, No Stench 18\" Pampas Grass Decorative Plants, for Home Decor Wedding Party Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61go9jy3aML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Natural Pampas Decor: Natural dried pampas grass set, a elegant readymade arrangement with pampas grass 30pcs. Natural Materials: 100% natural dried pampas grass set, they retain dried pampas grass original color and the feathers are full and even, giving you the original touch, non-toxic and harmless, an excellent choice to enrich any interior design, bringing more light and texture, for a modern, natural decor. Suitable for Various Vase: The total height of the dried pampas grass is about 45CM/17.7in, the feather part is between 20-33CM/7.9\"-13\", suitable for many styles of vases. 30 pcs can meet the needs of various caliber vases and more flower arrangements. Natural dried pampas grass do not need to daily care and pruning, which is suitable for all seasons. Here you can feel the charm of nature. DIY Natural Decoration: Pampas grass decor has a comfortable feel, soft and fluffy that is the best choice for flower arrangement. Natural dried pampas grass are perfect for indoor and outdoor decor, it can be set the mood as vase fillers, wedding decor, DIY Christmas and door wreath, placed around table, living room, country decor etc. Also special present for the holiday, birthday, housewarming and special events. Make a beautiful bouquet for the family and friends you love. Tips: These pampas decor are naturally dried grass, they may experience a lightly shedding, without losing the richness and softness of the plume. It is normal about shedding. You can put them under the sun for few hours to make it fluffy before use. Shedding will be minimal once you place in vase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61go9jy3aML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Taomika","source_asin":"B09GY99C34","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-978552","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GY99C34","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GY99C34","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
