window.products.push({"id":978570,"name":"Brass Akhand Jyot Oil Lamp Tea Light Holder with Diamond Crystal Decoration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FSYsmnlXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Brass akhand diya diamond crystal deepak/dia akhand jyot magical lantern brass diya decorative brass crystal oil lamp tea light holder lantern puja lamp/birthday candel/lamp candle when the fan is on as the diya comes with a lid. This beautiful lamp is used for lighting purposes using a cotton ball. It is used in Hindu temples for lighting and prayer purposes. Also commonly used during Indian festive occasions like diwali and navratras. It is a wonderful item for lighting and decoration at festive times and to brighten up your house. Can be used for candle light dinner care instructions: wet the diya with water, sour with pitambari powder for extra shine, wash well under running water, wipe clean with dry cloth, do not use steel wool or wire mesh for cleaning, always clean glass with a sponge and liquid soap.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FSYsmnlXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"shivshakti global store","source_asin":"B07MDPTVMY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-978570","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MDPTVMY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MDPTVMY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":978571,"name":"Shotgunner - Beer Funnel/Beer Snorkel/Beer Bong. The Beer Shotgunning Tool and Drink Snorkel Fits Beer Cans, Seltzer Tall Cans and Beer Bottles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41rso3wPQrL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"The shotgunner drink snorkel is super easy to use with these simple steps also shown in the photos.1.) Place the straw end into your drink of choice.2.) Slide silicone gasket firmly over can or bottle3.) Put the silicone tube opening in your mouth4.)Flip the can or bottle upright (so the bottle goes upside down)5.) Quickly and Easily chug your drink. **Occasionally a minor drip from the straw will occur**The Shotgunner is extremely easy to clean. Separate the straw from the silicone gasket and wash both pieces with warm soapy water or throw right in your dishwasher.***Pro Tip*** If using a can leave the tab facing strait up so the silicone tip on the straw can easily slide in or outThe Shotgunner is perfect for college parties, at the beach, in the dorm, birthdays, spring break, long weekends, regular weekends, music festivals, pre-game warm ups, post-game celebrations, day drinking, night drinking, tailgates, bachelor parties, and bible study. The Shotgunner party funnel is socially acceptable in all situations.Like all of my other products this comes with a ***LIFETIME FREE REPLACEMENT WARRANTY*** If anything arrives damaged, becomes damaged or needs to be replaced, just send us a message and we will take care of it free of charge.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41rso3wPQrL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Versapong","source_asin":"B08M4GKYR1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-978571","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08M4GKYR1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08M4GKYR1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
