window.products.push({"id":978649,"name":"Cibeat 8 oz Ramekins Bowls, Set of 8, Porcelain Dipping Sauce Bowls, Oven Safe, Classic Style Ramekins for Baking Souffle Ramekins, Creme Brulee Porce","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y3gpXbjDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RELIABLE CERAMIC QUALITY - The ceramic product is high-fired using natural clay, water and gas. It’s made to tolerate high temperatures up to 482°F. Fridge safe and microwave/oven safe. Compared to plastic or stainless steel one, ceramic is free of heavy metals and doesn’t absorb food odors or flavors. VERSATILE WITH PERFECT SIZE - 8 oz classic and simple style ramekins are perfect for preparing and serving a variety of dishes, including souffle, creme brulee, lava cakes, dipping sauces, french onion soup, olives, quiche, and ice cream. VARIETY COLOR - No matter what dishes you would like to serve, our ramekins are always ready to live up to your expectations by appearance. If you are tired of the traditional usage, make use of your creativity and combination of ideas to discover more about the possibilities of ramekins. EASY TO CLEAN - These soufflé dishes are stackable and DON'T take up a lot of space in your cupboard. They have a glazed coating so it is quite smooth, so easy to clean! You can wash them with soap and hot water or place them into your dishwasher. WELL PACKAGE - We wrap these ramekins in foam, and the transport damage rate is very low. If the product is broken when you receive it, please feel free to contact us, we will surely offer you a satisfied solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y3gpXbjDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cibeat","source_asin":"B0BWTHQBWQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-978649","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWTHQBWQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWTHQBWQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":978650,"name":"Sole Designs Ali Collection Padded Headboard Panel Hardwood Frame and 8 Button Tufted, Twin Sized Cotton Upholstered Adjustable Headboard 43\" L x 26\" ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":178.82,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713AGOymFNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add a luxurious touch to your bedroom with this beautifully upholstered headboard by Sole Designs . Part of the Ali Collection, Our upholstered headboard has a button tufted design, which creates a wonderful addition to your bedroom decor. Instill a meaningful design with 8 deep inset buttons. This elegant look is combined with soft foam padding so you can lean back comfortably on the bed while watching television, reading, working or even eating. The headboard is a beautiful combination of function, form and design. It adds a distinctive touch to most bedrooms . It is both fashionable and comfortable. This Upholstered Headboard offers a great way to finish off your bedroom decor. Artisan crafted and hand made in the USA to meet the superior quality our customers deserve and demand. So sleep soundly with a piece that imparts a sense of tranquility amidst an impressive backdrop of style. Headboard Details: - Foam Padded Cotton  - Deep 8 Button Tufting  - Set Includes: One (1) Headboard, Installation Kit  - Materials: Hardwood, Metal and Cotton  - Upholstery Color: Purple Thistle Print  - Dimensions: 26\"H x 43\"W x 2\"D  - Adjustable Height: Up to 56\" Inches Why Choose SOLE Designs? S.O.L.E. which means \"to stand alone\", or \"by itself\", stands for \"Service, Originality, Loyalty and Excellence.\" Service to our customers, Originality in our styles and fabric selection, Loyalty to our customers and Excellence as a company in every aspect. At S.O.L.E., we strive to offer the best in the manufactured components and the quality of our products. We are always searching and creating new ideas for our product to fulfill your wants and needs thus not only enhancing color to your rooms but changing it to a more elegant and charming look fulfilling your goal of a dream home or business. After a long and stressful workday, that could be more relaxing than resting in a quiet and elegant atmosphere?","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713AGOymFNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sole Designs","source_asin":"B01B3Q31KA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-978650","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01B3Q31KA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01B3Q31KA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
