window.products.push({"id":978737,"name":"Maccyafst Blacklight Chakra Tapestry Yoga Meditation Wall Tapestry UV Reactive Spiritual Mandala Backdrop Tapestry Colorful Bohemian Studio Room Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kITBxNa2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UV/Black Light Reactive: The blacklight chakra tapestry glow brightly under black light or UV light, colorful chakra mandala and beautiful wings pattern present a wonderful picture, will be a good decor for your home. Soft Material: This boho mandala tapestry is made of premium polyester fiber which is soft, durable and anti-wrinkle, can be hung with decorative tacks or push pins. Standard Size: Available in three sizes. 1#: H51.2”X W59.1”(130cm*150cm), 2#: H59.1”X W78.7” (150cm*200cm); 3#: H70.8”X W92.5” (180cm*235cm). Wash Suggestion: Please gentle hand or machine wash in cold water; hang dry or tumble dry low; don’t bleach or iron. Wide Use: The soft and lightweight purple yoga tapestry is suitable for indoor or outdoor use. They can be used as a a wall hanging, beach throw, picnic blanket, porch hanging, tablecloth, bedspread or bed sheet, sofa couch cover, window curtain or room divider.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kITBxNa2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maccyafst","source_asin":"B0878BTVX5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-978737","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0878BTVX5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0878BTVX5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":978738,"name":"Waffle Blanket - Waffle Throw Blanket - White Waffle Throw - Waffle Throw Cotton - Organic Cotton Waffle Throw - 100% Cotton Throw Blanket - White Waf","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Wxmr-sdyL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Cotton Waffle Blanket: The pattern in white flavor, the waffle throw sizing 50x60 is perfect and elegant for any space every space it deserves. Because they're 100% Organic Cotton and woven in a flat weave that will form little \"honeycombs\" after washing, our blankets shrink, that are the hallmark of real waffle weave.The tiny pockets of the waffle weave trap air allowing lightweight warmth making it an excellent for year-round use alone or layered. White Waffle Weave Blanket: Moreover, the pattern in white flavor, the waffle throw sizing 50x60 is perfect and elegant for any space every space it deserves. Organic Waffle Throw White: Considering the comfort factor of our consumers, our cotton waffle throws blanket designed in a way it stays durable, reusable and reliable for long years of usage. The waffle throw shrinks as they are made of 100% organic virgin cotton. To prevent the throw from shrinking, wash your cotton clothing on a delicate cycle and in cold water. Because they're 100% Organic Cotton and woven in a flat weave that will form little \"honeycombs\" after washing, our blankets shrink, that are the hallmark of real waffle weave. Lots of times,  Blankets are described as \"waffle weave\", but maybe made of microfiber fabric, are just terry with a waffle pattern. They look like a waffle weave but lack the ability to shrink with washing, forming the little honeycombs that are the hallmark of real waffle weave. The honeycombs that form in real waffle weave blanket are critical because they offer vastly more surface area for water to evaporate from.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Wxmr-sdyL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"All Cotton and Linen","source_asin":"B07XDP6XMW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-978738","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XDP6XMW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XDP6XMW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
