window.products.push({"id":978765,"name":"Morihata Binchotan Activated Charcoal Natural Water Purifying Sticks (2)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-+Ohtc8vL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy a glass of pure, delicious water with our original binchotan charcoal purifying sticks. A premium activated charcoal, binchotan has been used in Japan for centuries to naturally filter and purify water. Morihata Binchotan comes from Kishu, where the use of this charcoal first originated. The carbonized wood features thousands of microscopic cavities that attract, trap, and neutralize impurities found in unfiltered tap water. Two sticks of charcoal can purify a gallon of water for up to three months and, unlike plastic filters, binchotan can be recycled after use. Reuse these eco-friendly sticks by crushing them up and adding them to your garden to promote healthy soil. PLEASE NOTE that this charcoal cannot be used for grilling or burning of any kind. Morihata Binchotan is available in 2- and 4-stick packs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-+Ohtc8vL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Morihata","source_asin":"B09BBG43QF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-978765","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BBG43QF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BBG43QF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
