window.products.push({"id":978787,"name":"Teacher Gifts for Women, AN AWESOME Teacher Stainless Steel Insulated Travel Tumbler with Lid, Birthday Christmas Teachers Day Appreciation Thank you ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.91,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qxinVfP1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GREAT TEACHER GIFTS: This awesome teacher travel tumbler will be a great teacher gift for teacher, professor, tutor, retiring teacher, principal, teacher assistant, women and anyone who love to teach. Ideal teacher appreciation gifts on Christmas, Birthday, Teacher's Day, first day of school, last day of school, graduation day, end of year and teacher retirement. DOUBLE WALL VACUUM INSULATION: The teacher appreciation gifts travel tumbler can keep the beverages at an ideal temperature. According to our tests, it can keep hot for 5 hours, and keep cold for 9 hours. Besides, due to insulation design, the insulated teacher tumbler surface will never get cold or hot to touch. SAFE & DURABLE STAINLESS STEEL: The teacher gifts travel tumbler is made of food grade 304 stainless steel material, which ensures that the teacher gifts travel tumbler is safe for your body, durable, not easy to damage, and does not leave a bad metallic taste in your mouth. Besides, high quality material can keep the teacher tumbler surface dry to increase your hand comfort. BPA FREE LID & EASY TO CLEAN: The insulated travel tumbler comes with 2 BPA free lids and 2 stainless steel straws, which is completely safe for you. There is a rubber gasket on the lid to effectively prevent leakage. In addition, 1 straw brush and 1 cup brush are included to make you easier to deal with the teacher tumbler filled with various beverages after using. SUITABLE FOR MANY OCCASIONS: This stainless steel travel tumbler is ideal for any beverages, like champagne, juices, cocktails, wine, coffee, beer, whiskey and more. Suitable for traveling, hiking, boating, fishing, camping, BBQ and daily use. Whether you are indoors or outdoors, this insulated teacher travel tumbler will satisfy you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qxinVfP1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gtmileo","source_asin":"B09F2VM9KP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-978787","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F2VM9KP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F2VM9KP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
