window.products.push({"id":978855,"name":"Axis Purple Shower Curtain with Liner - Modern Spa Candles Orchids Zen Art - Water-Repellent Polyester Curtains - Rust-Proof Grommets, with 12 Heavy-D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917x4lpvg8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Want to relax and unwind in your own bathroom? Bathrooms are often associated with relaxation and serenity. Imagine dipping into the bath tub filled with your favorite bath bombs, essential oils and rose petals. You can even light up scented candles or incense to fully embrace the mood. But your bathroom can only truly be a sanctuary if your eyes believe the full fantasy. And they can't do that if your shower curtains are uninspiring and drab. Turn your bathroom into a tranquil Purple Zen-like environment with Axis Purple Zen Candle Reflection Shower Curtain! Enter into a meditative state and relish the Zen-like experience after mounting your new Purple Zen candle shower curtain. Our 72” x 72” bathroom curtains feature a Purple flowers and Zen Reflection printed in full-color. Unwind and find your inner peace in the serenity of your tub or shower without worrying about the curtain falling or breaking. Our bathroom decor curtains come with extremely durable liners and rings. These are made to maintain the curtain’s shape and to withstand frequent sliding. The Zen-themed tapestry curtain’s design is digitally printed to ensure the vividness and vibrancy of all the details. The design won’t fade or bleed despite repeated washing. Still not convinced? Check out these features to help you make a decision: ✅ Hand or machine washable in cold water, tumble dry in low setting and warm iron the back side of the curtain ✅ Perfect gift for housewarming and birthday ✅ Made of eco-friendly polyester fabric ✅ Larger and longer than most curtains Relax and meditate in your very own bathroom. Add Axis Purple Mystic Night Shower Curtain to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917x4lpvg8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NewWorld Axis","source_asin":"B07VBYDCSZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-978855","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VBYDCSZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VBYDCSZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
