window.products.push({"id":978892,"name":"Southwestern Tribal Arrow Striped Western Cowboy Teal Brown Stripe Window Curtain Valance Topper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-AcrA8riL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"This print has a earthy palette of colors including teal-green, dark brown, rust brown, golden brown, and cream-brown colors.Delight your loved ones with this beautiful handmade 100% cotton valance handcrafted in North Carolina! Valance measures approx. 40/41 inches wide by 15 inches long. Valance will be sewn with a one inch top header ruffle plus 1 3/4 inch standard rod pocket UNLESS you need a 3\" rod pocket with or without the top header ruffle. You must let me know if you want the wider rod pocket.This is a made to order handcrafted item - It is not premade - but sewn after purchase. Ready to ship in just a few days.Fast & Short Details about this listed itemThis is a brand new / made to order handcrafted item - It is not pre-made - but sewn after purchase Approx. Width: 41 inches wide Approx. Length: 15\" long Fabric: 100% Cotton Handling time varies: usually 4-10 days before shipping \"sometimes rush orders are accepted - ask first\"  Your curtain rod may need more than one of these valances  One Inch Header Ruffle PLUS 1 3/4 Standard Rod Pocket UNLESS you need 3\" rod pocket sewn (no extra charge) \"you must tell me you want wider 3\" rod pocket with or without larger header\"  Care: Machine wash cold with like colors / line dry or dry on low  Curtains should be 1.5 to 2x the width of your window/curtain rod.  Here's some additional advice on ordering :  1 valance panel for up to 28/30 inches 2 panels for 29-56 inch window 3 panels for 57-84 inch 4 for 85-112 inch window.  Unlined valance is machine washable in cold water / line dry or dry on low, press as needed. This is not a licensed product. It is however, hand-crafted from licensed fabric purchased from retail shops. I am not affiliated with or sponsored by any of the trademark holders.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-AcrA8riL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B01M6XFCAM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-978892","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M6XFCAM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M6XFCAM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":978893,"name":"Emeril Lagasse 3.2 Quart/3 Liter Whistling Tea Kettle, Stainless Steel Whistling Tea Pot for Induction Stove Top, Fast to Boil Water for Home Kitchen ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lFaWqLeHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"3 Liter Capacity: The stainless steel tea kettle makes about 101 oz of hot water. Ideal for single person making tea or coffee in a day. Perfect Whistling Sound: The tea kettle releases a loud whistle when the water has reached a boiling point. When you focus on doing housework, watching movies and other activities, the teapot will whistle to remind you when the water is boiling, you can hear it from another room after the water boils. Energy-Saving Fast And Safe Heating: The teapot for stove is composed of food-grade 304 stainless steel, iron and aluminum, forming a heating capsule, and the bottom rises quickly and evenly. This means less waiting time and a more efficient tea or coffee brewing experience! The Heat-Resistant Handle allows you to hold the teapot with your bare hands without being burned, and no plastic will touch the water ENSURE YOUR HEALTHY LIFE: The outer layer of our kettle is high temperature resistant paint, which will not fade easily and is washable. And simultaneously the removable lid makes it easy to keep the inside clean. It will be the same as new after cleaning. Our product is free of Teflon and BPA, ensuring your health of drinking water. Sutable for Various Stoves: Tea kettle uitable for Induction cooker, Electric stoves, Gas stoves, Radiant stove, Halogen stove. Attention that don't boil water on gas stove with large fire, as it heats up very quickly and saves energy. Although you can use anti-scalding gloves, we still suggest you boiled water use small & medium fire.Please make sure that the kettle lid and spout lid are completely closed, and do not overfill the kettle, or the whistle may not work.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lFaWqLeHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Emeril Lagasse","source_asin":"B0BL9W1R3C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-978893","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL9W1R3C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL9W1R3C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
