window.products.push({"id":978943,"name":"H&D HYALINE & DORA Crystal Carps Art Animal Sculpture Fish Tank Aquarium Decor Table Collectibles Ornament,5.7in","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F6ziPDXpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ゆBeautiful Meaning Crystal Art—Carp is the most popular mascot in China. It has been loved by people since ancient times, because it has the meaning of auspiciousness, wealth and bravery, and it is the yearning for a better life in people's hearts. Smooth lines outline the carp swimming posture, a symbol of the brave and pursuit. Crystal art carp ornaments put it in your home, it will bring you luck and blessings. ゆRemarkable Crystal Art Animal Figurine—High-quality materials and exquisite craftsmanship make it beautifully crafted, with smooth contours and three-dimensional realism. Green brings vitality, and it will be brighter in the sun. Carp decor paperweight also have high ornamental value. High temperature will ensure no fading and oxidation. Material: crystal. Size: 4.5*2.2in. NW.: 111g. Gift box packed. ゆ Surprising Gift Idea—The crystal art figurine carp sculpture is both a work of art and the perfect gift, so it is widely popular on many meanings occasions, including graduations, birthdays, hostess gifts, housewarmings, weddings and etc.. Moreover, You could also give it to your lover and other people you want to encourage on these festivals, such as Mother's Day, Christmas, Thanksgiving, Teacher's Day, Valentine's Day and etc., give them the best wishes. ゆGlass Sculpture Decorative Diversity—As a symbol of auspicious, wealthy and happy, its unique elegance is suitable for many major occasions, such as high-level meetings, banquets, annual meetings, weddings, commemorative ceremonies, company exhibition halls, meeting and reception rooms, etc. You could also place it as a home decor ornament, such as living room, shelf, collection cabinet, table top, bedroom to bring happiness and beauty to your home. ゆQuality And Good After-Service—All of the H&D Crystal pieces are lovingly hand-produced in China, using traditional lost wax sculpting techniques, the color and dimensions will vary slightly. During the production, the gaps between colorful crystals blocks will naturally form bubbles. It is the unique charms of crystal art sculpture, which will not affect its own beauty at all. If you have any problems with your package, we will solve for you asap.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F6ziPDXpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"H&D HYALINE & DORA","source_asin":"B09Q85TVZT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-978943","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q85TVZT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q85TVZT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":978944,"name":"Timex T133 Jumbo Display Nature Sounds Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31WDW60F9VL._AC_.jpg","description":"Amazon.com The Timex T133 large-display nature-sounds alarm clock wakes the early riser with a choice of a buzzer or three realistic nature sounds. You can choose a babbling brook, ocean surf, or birds of paradise. It features a 1.8-inch red display and a high-low dimmer. The battery backup maintains clock and alarm programming in case of power failure. The smooth, black finish suits any décor. The Timex Story Timex Group B.V. is one of the best-known American watch companies. Timex's U.S. headquarters are located in Middlebury Connecticut and it has substantial operations in China, the Philippines and India and full scale sales companies in Canada, the UK, France and Mexico. The company began in 1854 as Waterbury Clock in Connecticut's Naugatuck Valley, known during the nineteenth century as the \"Switzerland of America.\" Sister company Waterbury Watch manufactured the first inexpensive mechanical pocket watch in 1880. During World War I, Waterbury began making wristwatches, which had only just become popular, and in 1933 it made history by creating the first Mickey Mouse clock under license from Walt Disney, with Mickey's hands pointing the time. During World War II, Waterbury renamed itself U.S. Time Company. In 1950 the company introduced a wristwatch called the Timex. Over the next three decades, Timex was sold through a series of advertisements which emphasized its durability by putting the watch through \"torture tests,\" such as falling over the Grand Coulee Dam or being strapped to the propeller of an outboard motor, with the slogan \"It takes a licking and keeps on ticking.\" With the help of former Olympic broadcaster, spokesman John Cameron Swayze, sales took off. The company later became Timex Corporation, then Timex Group and, to date, has sold over one billion watches. The company has remained very competitive and the Timex brand continues its dominance through present day. Its primary market remains the United States and Canada, although the Timex brand is sold worldwide due to its ability to capitalize on its strong brand image and reputation for quality. One of the most successful and important features available on many Timex watches is the Indiglo backlight system. Indiglo is a brand name of Indiglo Corporation, solely owned by Timex for licensing purposes. Timex electroluminescent lamps, branded Indiglo, were introduced in 1992 in the Ironman watch line. They were an immediate success. The Indiglo lamp uniformly lights the surface of the Timex’s watch dials in a manner that makes the dial read very easily in many different light settings. In some newer watches the Indiglo backlight only lights up the numbers, rather than the entire LCD display, which is achieved by means of a specialized film that inverts the LCD transmissivity. Today, Timex Group products are manufactured in the Far East and in Switzerland often based on technology that continues to be developed in the United States and in Germany. With a large and varied line of watches, Timex has the style for everyone. From the locker room to the board room, there is a great Timex style time-piece for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31WDW60F9VL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Timex","source_asin":"B00004VXA3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-978944","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004VXA3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004VXA3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
