window.products.push({"id":978983,"name":"Tom duBois THE PROMISE HAND SIGNED by the Artist Paper Lithograph","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qknRXAMkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"“The Promise” by Tom duBois Out of print - hard to find . This is an Authentic SIGNED fine art print. This print is HAND SIGNED IN PEN BY THE ARTIST! . It has never been framed and is in MINT condition. . The image size is 14 1/4\" x 20 1/4\" . This is the same print that is sold in fine art galleries. This is the hand signed FULL IMAGE SIZE 14 1/4\" x 20 1/4\", NOT the long and narrow UNSIGNED CROPPED version (9-1/2\" X 25-1/2\") The following Bible scripture is written on the bottom white border: \"When the rainbow is in the cloud, then I will look upon it to remember the everlasting promise between God and every living creature of all flesh that is on the Earth.\" Genesis 9:16 Prints are shipped in a rigid tube.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qknRXAMkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tom duBois","source_asin":"B001JYTDQI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-978983","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001JYTDQI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001JYTDQI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":978984,"name":"Santa Head and Mistletoe on Red Glass Christmas Tree Topper 11 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.92,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mIQWwMOvL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"11 Inches Tall (28 cm) German Glass Italian Paint Mouth Blown Hand Painted Glittered Accents Made in Ukraine Apart from the Christmas balls, figurines, lights and bows, who wouldn't vie to place the most important piece of décor in every tree is the tree topper. It’s considered to be the crowning glory and adds a finishing touch that’s why it earned a special spot in the Christmas tree. Since in the 19th century, adding a tree topper became a tradition. It also goes to a debate about whether an angel or a star should be placed. Over the years, trendier designs arise which suits the taste and design of the generation. BestPysanky is home to hand-painted ornaments with intricate patterns and delicately detailed scenes. Decorate your tree or add tabletop centerpiece with our meticulously crafted topper using traditional techniques that originated in the 1800's. The Renaissance-era molding, glass blowing, silver lining, painting and finishing processes require unparalleled skill and several weeks to complete. The molten glass is mouth-blown into finely carved molds to shape the topper. It is then painted and glittered in a series of labor-intensive steps to achieve the beautiful final products. Exquisite workmanship and details are the hallmark of all BestPysanky ornaments. We aim to bring warmth, color, spirit and sparkle into your home with our unique decor, as you admire and celebrate the holidays with your loved ones. It's more than just a decoration- it's a work of art!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mIQWwMOvL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BestPysanky","source_asin":"B016HF89NQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-978984","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B016HF89NQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B016HF89NQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
