window.products.push({"id":978989,"name":"XXIN Can Opener and Swivel Vegetable Peeler, 4-in-1 Manual Stainless Steel Handheld Can Openers with 1 Potatoe Peeler, green, Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+pUtPTINL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"4 in 1 Manual Can Opener Handheld can opener can open jarcans and beer bottles, unscrew bottle caps, pry canned lids, easy turn knob can opener can open jar and beer bottles pry canned lids unscrew bottle Vegetable Peeler to easily complete the daily work of the kitchen,the rotatable blade is specially designed for the lefthander and is also suitable for righthanded use. Manual Can Opener Design Features: High quality material: the manual can opener made of highquality 1810 foodsafe hardness stainless steel material extremely strong, effective and durable Easy to open:the bottle openers is sharp enough to cut the lid of cans precisely and smoothly in seconds Easy to store and carry:this manual can opener can be placed in cabinet rack wallmounted drawer, lighter in weight and easy to carry, suitable for parties outdoor picnics camping etc Exquisite gifts for loved ones: the can opener ergonomic handles, a great helper and nice gift for beloved woman and seniors with weaker grip strengths or arthritis How to Use The Manual Can Opener: step 1:open handles until the blades and gears can be inserted into the edge of the can,clamp the can with gears and blades, until the blade is cut into the can's lid step 2:hold the handle tightly and rotate the knot in a clockwise direction, keeping the blade piercing and puncturing the lid until the can is totally open step 3:clean the can opener with a soft towel or running water, open out fully to make it dry up quickly, place it in a dry place and keep it dry step 4: enjoy delicious canned Package Included: 1 4in1 cans bottles opener 1 vegetable peeler Tip: 1.Do not open the lid completely to prevent the lid from falling on the food.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+pUtPTINL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XXIN","source_asin":"B08XXN42Q2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-978989","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XXN42Q2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XXN42Q2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
